  - formal verification
  - constructive mathematics
abstract: >-
  A manuscript deriving a mass gap for lattice gauge theory over every
  compact simple group, constructively over the positive naturals, together
  with its Lean 4 formalization: two libraries, MassGap and MassGapChecks,
  Lean core alone, every declaration at the empty axiom set and every check
  module decided by the kernel.  The manuscript is a completed proof of the
  Yang-Mills mass gap; the Lean tree is its transcription in progress, and
  the README states which clauses of the main theorem it holds at this
  version and which remain open.
